<p>Obour's core value proposition is simple: a working city with real services at a noticeably lower cost than New Cairo or the Fifth Settlement. But "affordable" only means something against a budget. This guide breaks the cost of living into the five categories that actually matter and shows you how to build your own monthly figure.</p>
